{"id":"50496a022b75cf4f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modal-substitution.md","title":"模态公式的变量支撑与一致代入","display":"df-modal-substitution — 模态公式的变量支撑与一致代入","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modal-substitution","aliases":["72-df-modal-substitution"],"display":"df-modal-substitution — 模态公式的变量支撑与一致代入","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-formula]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §2, print477–480/PDF489–492; explicit finite-tree recursion","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modal-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modal-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-substitution — 模态公式的变量支撑与一致代入"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §2, print477–480/PDF489–492; explicit finite-tree recursion"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m\">\\(\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\omega\\to\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\sigma:\\omega\\to\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pv}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{pv}_m\\)</span> 输出有限变量指标集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_m\">\\(\\sigma_m\\)</span> 为下式定义的同时代入扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(p_i)&amp;:=\\{i\\},\\quad\\operatorname{pv}_m(\\bot_m):=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(A\\to_m B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\cup\\operatorname{pv}_m(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(\\Box_m A):=\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\\\\n\\sigma_m(p_i)&amp;:=\\sigma(i),\\quad\\sigma_m(\\bot_m):=\\bot_m,\\\\\n\\sigma_m(A\\to_m B)&amp;:=\\sigma_m(A)\\to_m\\sigma_m(B),\\quad\n\\sigma_m(\\Box_m A):=\\Box_m\\sigma_m(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(p_i)&amp;:=\\{i\\},\\quad\\operatorname{pv}_m(\\bot_m):=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(A\\to_m B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\cup\\operatorname{pv}_m(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(\\Box_m A):=\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\\\\n\\sigma_m(p_i)&amp;:=\\sigma(i),\\quad\\sigma_m(\\bot_m):=\\bot_m,\\\\\n\\sigma_m(A\\to_m B)&amp;:=\\sigma_m(A)\\to_m\\sigma_m(B),\\quad\n\\sigma_m(\\Box_m A):=\\Box_m\\sigma_m(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>模态语法没有变量绑定，代入不需要α改名；只沿严格子树递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 可以在不同指标上取相同公式，也可把原子换成含方框的公式。对给定A，仅需读取有限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\)</span> 中的输入，不能将一致代入误作只替换最外层命题骨架而忽略方框内部。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-formula]]；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\sigma:\\omega\\to\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\omega\\to\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pv}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(p_i)&:=\\{i\\},\\quad\\operatorname{pv}_m(\\bot_m):=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(A\\to_m B)&:=\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\cup\\operatorname{pv}_m(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(\\Box_m A):=\\operatorname{pv}_m(A),\\\\\n\\sigma_m(p_i)&:=\\sigma(i),\\quad\\sigma_m(\\bot_m):=\\bot_m,\\\\\n\\sigma_m(A\\to_m B)&:=\\sigma_m(A)\\to_m\\sigma_m(B),\\quad\n\\sigma_m(\\Box_m A):=\\Box_m\\sigma_m(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1802,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-443","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-substitution|df-modal-substitution — 模态公式的变量支撑与一致代入]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-427","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-substitution]]"},{"id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-substitution]] 的自由语法树、变量支撑和同时代入。$i,j\\in\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"模态一致代入：[[72-df-modal-substitution]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-substitution|df-modal-substitution — 模态公式的变量支撑与一致代入]]"},{"id":"d995f8111ca2cd42","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$、$\\sigma,\\sigma_m,\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]；不要求R满足GL框架条件。"},{"id":"799dbc6630c443a3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi_A$ 与有限反模型界 $2^{|\\Phi_A|}$ 取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]；$\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]。"},{"id":"0a8c770817bc3365","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\sigma_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m$ 有限；$\\sigma_m[\\Gamma]:=\\{\\sigma_m(B):B\\in\\Gamma\\}$。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-modal-substitution]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-modal-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["94fb82dfe6146007"]}